<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ファミレス.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "700" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The place we arrived at was Zahha.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So he was going to let us talk here, unhurried.<PG>
"Welcome. A table for two?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As ever, there were a lot of groups that looked like high-schoolers.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\喫煙席.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
We were shown to seats in the smoking section and sat down.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, my mistake. Um, sorry, I've gone and put us in the smoking section out of habit..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Oh, it's quite all right, a little thing like that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> scratched his head, looking sheepish, and I grinned from ear to ear at him in return.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\喫煙席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Besides, since almost all the customers were high-schoolers, there was nobody in this smoking booth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was perfect for talking about the incident.<PG>
"Welcome. This is our new spring menu."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as the waitress went to set the menu down,<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Y-You there!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> suddenly stood up, and his cheeks bloomed bright red like fireworks.<PG>
"Wh-What is it, <STYLE ID="1">sir</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The waitress opened her eyes perfectly round.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My eyes, too, were <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="くぎ">riveted</STYLE> on <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "伊勢.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\喫煙席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And then, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> thrust his police ID at the waitress.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I-I-I am a police officer! I am by no means a suspicious character!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Just because I have </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">a beautiful girl like this one</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> with me... by no means... by no means!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Buh?"<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hwuh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The waitress and I cocked our heads at the same moment, and let out question marks that gave no hint which hole they had come from.<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPD TIME="4294967256">"Listen! In general, a beautiful girl is a thing to be admired, and laying a hand on one must never, under any circumstances, be permitted! This is the founding principle of the Motoki Bishojo Appreciation Society! Much more so, a sexual offense against a beautiful girl is beyond all words!</STYLE>
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">　Our activities aim at admiring beautiful girls and at the same time at the healthy upbringing of beautiful girls! Even should one meet a beautiful girl, photographing or filming her without permission is never allowe</STYLE>
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
<TXSPN>"U-Uh, <STYLE ID="1">sir</STYLE>, I understand, so, your order..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah... yeah... my apologies... I just..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> went quiet and sat back down.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "78" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, have you already had lunch? If not, order whatever you like."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, I've already eaten! Thank you very much!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The truth was, I had wanted that steak set from before and the spring parfait, but I had to hold back at least a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Here I should go like a proper JK: the drink bar and a strawberry mille-feuille. [TN: JK = joshi kosei, a high-school girl]<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\喫煙席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Once the ordering was done and I came back from the drink bar, <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> let out a great sigh. [TN: a self-serve drinks counter]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> put his lips to his cup to drink his coffee.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're really rather... what they call... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">a looker?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I praised him, grinning from ear to ear,
{PLAYSND "SE\鼻をかむ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> sprayed his coffee out magnificently.<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Cough! Cough!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"M-My nose..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> wiped his mouth and nose with a paper napkin, and I wiped up the coffee that had splattered over the table.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time I had seen anyone spray a drink out in a mist like in a manga.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"G-</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... Don't say strange things out of nowhere..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>'s way of calling me seemed to have become "<STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If he sprayed his coffee out again, there was a chance it would land on me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I had better be careful about what I say and do as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But I had one thing on my mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the moment I met him, I had had a doubt about <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>, on intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether it is a thing I may confirm or not, I do not know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But for the sake of the conversation to come, I absolutely must confirm it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE> took another mouthful of coffee.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, I grinned from ear to ear at <STYLE ID="1">Ise-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
